│ at 80.2% (95% CI, 78.8%-81.7%) maximum heart rate in the high-intensity group and 3.2 (95% CI, 2.8-3.6;              │
│ P\u2009=\u2009.13) days per week at 65.9% (95% CI, 64.2%-67.7%) maximum heart rate in the moderate-intensity group   │
│ (P\u2009<\u2009.001). The mean change in Unified Parkinson\'s Disease Rating Scale motor score in the high-intensity │
