(PDSS-2) total score (P\u2009=\u20090.039), Motor Symptoms at Night (PDSS-2) score (P\u2009=\u20090.039), PD Symptoms at
Night (PDSS-2) score (P\u2009=\u20090.029), Disturbed Sleep (PDSS-2) score (P\u2009=\u20090.037). The BQG showing       
functional mobility capacity greater improvements in the Berg Balance Scale (P\u2009=\u20090.041) and 6-minute walk test
(P\u2009=\u20090.042), and greater decrease in the Timed Up & Go (s; P\u2009=\u20090.046). The BQG showing gait function
