│ (PFS-16), Beck Depression Inventory, Starkstein Apathy Scale (SAS), and Montreal Cognitive Assessment (MOCA) scale.  │
│ RESULTS Repeated-measures analysis of variance revealed significant Time\u2009×\u2009Group interactions for          │
