  Parkinson\'s disease", "abstract": "PURPOSE To measure motor function improvements in patients with Parkinson\'s      
  disease (PD) using Health Qigong exercises. PATIENTS AND METHODS Fifty-two PD patients (Hoehn and Yahr stages I to    
