126, "title": "Efficacy of a physical therapy program in patients with Parkinson\'s disease: a randomized controlled 
trial", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To investigate the effects of a physical therapy (PT) program in groups of people with 
Parkinson\'s disease (PD). DESIGN Randomized controlled trial with a crossover design. SETTING Two outpatient 
